00:28:11.940 --> 00:28:14.400
to show you there are
tons of capabilities.

00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:17.640
And the objective is to
be more prescriptive when

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:19.260
you talk to your customers.

00:28:19.260 --> 00:28:21.630
Yes, it's great that we
have a lot of constructs

00:28:21.630 --> 00:28:24.330
around capture, curate,
discover, manage,

00:28:24.330 --> 00:28:25.920
and consume and manage.

00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:30.210
But you, as a potential
partner or customer,

00:28:30.210 --> 00:28:33.630
you need to figure out what
is the right use case for you.

00:28:33.630 --> 00:28:35.190
What is the right
construct for you?

00:28:35.190 --> 00:28:38.330
And then try to figure out,
here's what I need to do.

00:28:38.330 --> 00:28:42.120
It may be cloud data prep,
cloud data flow, cloud Pub/Sub,

00:28:42.120 --> 00:28:43.710
and BigQuery.

00:28:43.710 --> 00:28:45.750
So these are the ones
