00:28:45.750 --> 00:28:47.040
The rest, it's great to have.

00:28:47.040 --> 00:28:50.220
I can look into it later, but
to show that to your customers

00:28:50.220 --> 00:28:55.560
from the get-go could
be counter-productive.

00:28:55.560 --> 00:28:59.910
Now, there are customers who
basically say, you know what?

00:28:59.910 --> 00:29:02.920
I don't like this whole
thing about the migration.

00:29:02.920 --> 00:29:05.730
So I want a white-glove
type of service.

00:29:05.730 --> 00:29:07.620
And that's where
Accenture comes in.

00:29:07.620 --> 00:29:09.742
With every vendor, you
looked at the vendors

00:29:09.742 --> 00:29:10.700
in the previous slides.

00:29:10.700 --> 00:29:12.210
There are so many of them.

00:29:12.210 --> 00:29:14.010
And with so many of
them, basically that

00:29:14.010 --> 00:29:16.920
gives you the freedom
to choose, but also

00:29:16.920 --> 00:29:20.730
gives you the potential that you
