00:29:52.750 --> 00:29:53.880
We take care of that.

00:29:53.880 --> 00:29:55.171
So that's part of the contract.

00:29:55.171 --> 00:29:58.520
And we also have capabilities
around different types

00:29:58.520 --> 00:30:01.480
of elements when it comes to
capture, curate, discover,

00:30:01.480 --> 00:30:02.670
consume, and manage.

00:30:02.670 --> 00:30:04.520
So there are different
capabilities there.

00:30:04.520 --> 00:30:06.840
I'm not going to go into
them, but just be aware

00:30:06.840 --> 00:30:09.750
that they are available to you.

00:30:09.750 --> 00:30:12.170
Here's the SDM type of
approach under the covers.

00:30:12.170 --> 00:30:14.820
Basically, we cater
to a different type

00:30:14.820 --> 00:30:16.050
of cloud providers.

00:30:16.050 --> 00:30:18.270
GCP happens to be one of them.

00:30:18.270 --> 00:30:21.210
Under the cover, the right
tools would be procured,

00:30:21.210 --> 00:30:24.069
licenses managed for
you, and you get to that.

00:30:24.069 --> 00:30:25.360
So you're pretty much agnostic.

00:30:25.360 --> 00:30:27.420
You don't care
about whether it's

00:30:27.420 --> 00:30:30.200
tool A, tool B, that vendor
