00:30:30.200 --> 00:30:31.470
or are they still in business.

00:30:31.470 --> 00:30:32.610
Doesn't matter.

00:30:32.610 --> 00:30:35.070
We just give you the
guarantee that data be there.

00:30:35.070 --> 00:30:37.470
You're not locked into
